---
title: "Timed presentation"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  s0: Nothing plays
  s1: The presentation plays
  s2: Held while the game pauses
  s3: The presentation finished
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: the mod starts it
  s1 --> s0: the mod cancels it
  s1 --> s2: the game pauses
  s0 --> s2: the mod starts it
  s2 --> s1: the game resumes
  s2 --> s0: the mod cancels it
  s1 --> s3: its last step plays
  s3 --> s0: the mod cancels it
  s3 --> s1: the mod starts it
  s3 --> s2: the mod starts it
